# yt-dlp defaults
# Options here are parsed BEFORE the command line, so anything you type
# on the command line overrides these.

# Cap video at 720p: best video <=720p + best audio, falling back to the
# best pre-merged file <=720p when separate streams aren't available.
-f bv*[height<=720]+ba/b[height<=720]

# Frame-accurate cuts when using --download-sections.
# No effect on normal downloads; re-encodes (slower) only when sections are used.
--force-keyframes-at-cuts

# Carry title/artist/etc. and cover art into the output file.
--embed-metadata
--embed-thumbnail
